time... [laughing]


01:46:01.707 --> 01:46:03.078
Okay, I'm locking in.


01:46:03.214 --> 01:46:05.178
We have to find her.


01:46:05.313 --> 01:46:06.248
But until then...


01:46:06.384 --> 01:46:08.178
[Lohan] Until then, what?


01:46:08.313 --> 01:46:10.273
[laughing] I don't know
why I keep going... [gasps]


01:46:10.356 --> 01:46:13.457
♪ <i>Pissin' the night away</i> ♪


01:46:13.592 --> 01:46:15.111
-[crew laughing]
-[crew member] I can't. Sorry.


01:46:15.194 --> 01:46:17.621
♪ <i>Danny Boy</i> ♪


01:46:17.757 --> 01:46:19.122
[crew continues laughing]


01:46:19.257 --> 01:46:21.795
[director] Okay, Jamie,
reach for the enema box.


01:46:22.197 --> 01:46:23.326
[laughs]


01:46:23.462 --> 01:46:25.535
Mm. Mmm.


01:46:26.432 --> 01:46:27.436
Mmm.


01:46:27.572 --> 01:46:29.204
-She's had 29 doughnuts.
-[both chuckle]


01:46:29.340 --> 01:46:30.501
Just give me the doughnut.


01:46:30.637 --> 01:46:31.744
You're prediabetic.


01:46:31.880 --> 01:46:34.137
[gasps] What's that?


01:46:37.183 --> 01:46:38.201
Not supposed to eat those.


01:46:38.284 --> 01:46:40.644
You learned a lesson. [laughs]


01:46:41.080 --> 01:46:42.981
My God, I could
be a pirate, huh?


01:46:43.116 --> 01:46:45.485
[in English accent]
Oh, you fancy that?


01:46:45.620 --> 01:46:46.752
Put on my jumper, eat my...


01:46:46.887 --> 01:46:48.852
-[all laugh]
-[Julia] I can't!


01:46:48.987 --> 01:46:51.257
You wanna fight?
I can fight too.


01:46:51.392 --> 01:46:52.522
Let's fight!


01:46:52.657 --> 01:46:54.133
Oh, my God.


01:46:54.269 --> 01:46:55.525
[students chanting] Let us out!


01:46:55.660 --> 01:46:56.829
Let us out!


01:46:56.965 --> 01:46:59.065
-Do you want to be fired?
-It's a hit.


01:46:59.201 --> 01:47:00.471
[laughs]


01:47:01.072 --> 01:47:02.240
[horn honks]


01:47:02.376 --> 01:47:04.077
Anna Louise Coleman,
do you think...


01:47:04.212 --> 01:47:07.111
[laughing] Is that
my middle name?


01:47:07.246 --> 01:47:08.914
Yes, it is your middle name.


01:47:09.050 --> 01:47:10.382
[Anna and Tess screaming]


01:47:14.990 --> 01:47:16.254
[Sherry] That's different.


01:47:16.390 --> 01:47:17.951
What's that? The
pink Power Ranger?


01:47:18.086 --> 01:47:20.654
[laughing] I'm kidding.
I'm kidding, I'm kidding.


01:47:20.790 --> 01:47:22.959
Let's not. Let's not. Let's not.


01:47:23.094 --> 01:47:24.825
Oh, my God!


01:47:26.200 --> 01:47:27.631
[George] What the hell is she?


01:47:27.766 --> 01:47:30.402
Was that a Pepto Bismol
comm... What is she doing?


01:47:32.271 --> 01:47:34.039
Here we are. In the pelvis.


01:47:34.174 --> 01:47:35.767
Like peanut butter molasses.


01:47:35.902 --> 01:47:37.844
-Yes.
-Peanut butter molasses.


01:47:37.980 --> 01:47:39.437
-Slow.
-[both laugh]


01:47:40.306 --> 01:47:43.474
Were any of those teenagers
a "Bad Boss Betty"?


01:47:43.610 --> 01:47:44.974
No. I'm sorry.


01:47:45.110 --> 01:47:47.187
-[spits]
-[Tess] Good. More.


01:47:47.322 --> 01:47:50.179
[Lohan laughing] That
really was so bad.


01:47:50.315 --> 01:47:52.490
[Jake] What are you
doing down there?


01:47:53.225 --> 01:47:54.452
Just crawling. [laughs]


01:47:54.587 --> 01:47:56.496
[crew laughing]


01:47:56.931 --> 01:47:58.029
Look at the road!


01:47:58.164 --> 01:47:59.663
-[screams]
-Oh!


01:48:00.466 --> 01:48:02.460
-I got caught!
-[crew member] Cut!


01:48:02.596 --> 01:48:04.161
That was fun.


01:48:04.296 --> 01:48:07.307
Thank you for watching.
We love you so much.


01:48:07.442 --> 01:48:09.874
-Thanks for coming.
-I think I just peed.


01:48:10.010 --> 01:48:11.806
[all laughing]


01:48:12.541 --> 01:48:13.577
[crew member] Okay, cut.

